; Optional: copy to launcher.ini next to SM2VRLauncher.exe. These are defaults; the user's choices in the
; launcher (saved in settings.ini) win over them.

; Your GitHub repository, owner/name, where releases (update zip + version.json) are published.
UpdateRepo=YOUR-GITHUB-NAME/sm2-vr

; Look for a new release when the launcher starts (1/0). Nothing installs without pressing Update.
CheckOnStart=0

; The mod folder, if the launcher does not live inside it (tools\launcher). A launcher inside an install
; always manages that install.
; PortRoot=C:\sm2-port

; Keep settings, logs and downloads in "launcher-data" beside the exe instead of %APPDATA%\SM2 VR Launcher.
; Use it for a second copy (a test build) so it shares nothing with your main one.
; Portable=1
